{"reviews":[{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-0","r":5.0,"t":"I loved it. Hair was soft an I did not ...","x":"I loved it.  Hair was soft an I did not have too much tangling problems","h":86,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-1","r":5.0,"t":"My new lace front /bestfriend","x":"[[VIDEOID:33163b1110c4936bd063512e07ca0602]] This is the best decision I'very made in a long time on a wig. I never felt more secure with this hair. I don't have to use glue or pins or anything. I been getting so many compliments on my hair. I feel so pretty when I go out. I of course had to do a video on this. You welcome to check it out on my youtube channel  [...]","h":71,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-2","r":5.0,"t":"All i can say is that im in love with my wig\ud83d\ude0d It looks exactly like the pic","x":"All i can say is that im in love with my wig\ud83d\ude0d It looks exactly like the pic. Very dense very soft hair 1000000 stars. Great seller will buy more","h":26,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-3","r":1.0,"t":"This wig is horrible!!","x":"This wig is horrible !!!! It looked used the strap is all stretched out and the hair is all over the place horrible horrible horrible!!!!!","h":24,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-4","r":5.0,"t":"Not what i expected this wig to fluffy (big hair when on my head )","x":"This wig doesn't look like the photo and it's to fluffy and gets more fluffy as I finger comb","h":23,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-5","r":4.0,"t":"GREAT BUY","x":"I love this wig,  I wanted to cut my hair but didn't have the courage so I brought this wig it looks very natural. The only reason I gave it a 4 star is because you can not change the part to the other side. If cut properly the hairline looks very natural.","h":15,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-6","r":5.0,"t":"Love, Love, Love","x":"I absolutely love this wig!  I just received it; however it is one of my favorites.  I will be ordering the similar wig also by Wigshow.  It looks just like the picture.  I only wish the part was 3&#34; instead of 2&#34;.  The hair is super soft and light on my head.  This is my best wig purchase.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-7","r":4.0,"t":"It fits great and the hair is sooo beautiful","x":"First arrived and the cap was extremely small. I contacted them and they sent a bigger cap. It fits great and the hair is sooo beautiful. No tangles, soft, flowing,  bouncy. They respond to emails right away, good customer service.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-8","r":3.0,"t":"\"Say Girl.....\" Style","x":"I LOVE this style. The hair itself tangles just a little (nothing too extreme unless you are doing the most)and started looking worn by just sitting on my counter.... For that reason, I would return it if I were not outside the allotted return time. But it's cool if you need to throw something on for a grocery run or a quick jog. If this were human... I'd have purchased HELLA them... Love the lace front and it was easy to cut... hairline is nice too.. It helps that i watched a couple of videos o","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-9","r":3.0,"t":"Short, curly","x":"Photo of wig posted below. I like that its short especially for the summer. Has combs in front & back. Curls easily with curling iron","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-10","r":5.0,"t":"I LOVE COLODO WIGS !","x":"I love COLODO wigs! I've purchased two already. These wigs are so soft and styled well. You can even wash and style with heat to your liking even though they are synthetic. They are also look and feel very natural. Did I mention the price? Very affordable! I will buy again really soon. I recommend these wigs to all. I have not been disappointed yet! Thanks again!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-11","r":5.0,"t":"YASSSS HONEY!!!!","x":"I wanted a cute curly style that was short & look natural for my graduation & man I found it! I love this wig it looks just like my hair. I had my cousin braid my hair & sew it on so I wouldn't have to worry bout it coming off! Came right on time with PRIME. I will be ordering more wigs from this company!!!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-12","r":4.0,"t":"but this really looks like the small one","x":"Just got my wig today.... I ordered the medium length.... but this really looks like the small one...BUT..... I think it is gorgeous and I love all the curls.... its natural looking as well which is a plus for me.... I was a little disappointed because the part is on the left side and I normally wear my parts on a right.... it looked awkward to me at first... also the wig was way too tight so I had to cut the straps in the back... I only use the Combs with a few bobby pens.... I played with it a","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-13","r":2.0,"t":"I agree with pretty much the other reviews","x":"I agree with pretty much the other reviews. there is side no part or closure as shown in the pictures and unless you know how to work with the synthetic hair it is really just that, very synthetic looking. good for wearing with hats or caps only.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great wig","x":"Great, exactly like pic. Very soft and natural looking","h":6,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-15","r":1.0,"t":"THIS IS THE WORST WIG THAT I HAVE EVER PURCHASED IN MY LIFE ...","x":"THIS IS THE WORST WIG THAT I HAVE EVER PURCHASED  IN MY LIFE IT STINKS, THE WIG LOOKS NOTHING LIKE THE PIC, AND YOU CANNOT EVEN WORK WITH IT. DON'T WASTE TIME OR MONEY","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-16","r":1.0,"t":"Worst wig ever","x":"It looks and feels like it's from family dollar. So plastic and looks so bad nothing like this pic and not returnable. I literally put iy in the garbage","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-17","r":1.0,"t":"Ewww","x":"Does not look like the picture and after about 3 days it got really nappy and unmanageable. Don't buy this","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-18","r":2.0,"t":"I want a wig that is comfortable.","x":"It's too bulky. I'm sure if I bought thinning shears for the hair it would help with that. The main issue is the lace itself. It is so hard that when I tried it on my head it scrapped my forehead and now I have scratches all over my forehead. Even when I cut the lace it's still hard. This is not a soft lace front it's as if it's made out of hard plastic. I want a wig that is comfortable.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-19","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"I absolutely love this wig!! I had my stylist to install it. She plucked the edges and created a part so it blends perfectly with my hairline. I have received so many compliments! I'm actually ordering another one right now, lol. #5stars","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-20","r":5.0,"t":"Super cute, lightweight and natural looking","x":"Super cute,  lightweight and natural looking . Very soft too.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-21","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"I have never seen a wig with a widow peak. Awful!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great order","x":"The wig was delivered on time which was perfect. It feels very soft and smooth which is nice also. It doesn't look like the picture but if you comb it to style it is very beautiful.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-23","r":5.0,"t":"Happy and very pleased","x":"Five star great sales reps who care and value costumers opinion and support.  Thank you for the order and being true to your word!! Must buy, great deal!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B01GZVQXGC-24","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"Not as expected. The curl pattern is different and lace is short.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the hair as soft and natural-looking.","cites":[1,3,6,7,8,11,12,15]},{"text":"Many say the wig looks just like the product photo.","cites":[3,7,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers complain the wig does not match the photo or is too fluffy/synthetic-looking.","cites":[5,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers note issues with the part or styling limitations.","cites":[6,7,13,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention tangling or the hair looking worn.","cites":[1,9]}]},"qa":[]}